     '6a1261d97ad5bda784f42181435c6138176c7acddb410bf653ba37aa3ebdba3f', 'Dal makhani, home style: INDB OSR139 as coded, with its butter and low-fat cream as written (founder oil default), and its 960 ml of water simmered down so the dish has the 74.7% water CoFID 12-468 measured in UK home urad dal (Leeds, 5 homes). Supersedes the OSR139 row 6afbebf2 (74.04 kcal: all the water kept, a thin plain-dal density) and takes its key ''dal makhani''; the spellings ''dal makhni'' and ''daal makhani'' get copies. OSR139''s two coding errors (whole urad coded as split B003; ''1 inch ginger'' coded as dried ground ginger G554) are kept as coded: fixing them is a recipe edit (about -2%). No restaurant row: restaurant meals get the +5 g oil rule. Confidence C (an external moisture anchor from a different dish; a home weighing would lift it).', 'founder 2026-11-15 (spec (i)6: value 110.40 at 74.7% water, key dal makhani, spelling copies dal makhni and daal makhani)', '058'),
