00000001 tsp", "name": "Chilli powder", "role": "kept", "water_g": 0.12}, {"as_written": "Lemon 0.25", "code": "E520", "g": 7.5, "g_as_written": null, "i": 10, "label": "Lemon 0.25", "name": "Lemons, flesh only, raw, weighed with peel and pips", "role": "kept", "water_g": 7.27}, {"as_written": "Oil 10 g", "code": "T508", "g": 1.34, "g_as_written": 10.0, "i": 11, "label": "Oil, sunflower: cut from INDB''s 10 g per 40 g poha so the dish''s fat is the Pune kanda pohe''s share of dry matter (lab 99: F 9.1 g at 22.3% water = 11.7%). The rule pins the dish''s TOTAL fat, not its oil: BFP044''s 10 g peanut (not in the lab dish, which has coconut instead) carries 58% of that fat, so the oil left over is likely leaner than the lab cook''s", "name": "Oil, sunflower", "role": "edited", "water_g": 0.0}, {"as_written": "Salt 0.5 tsp", "code": "G528", "g": 1.0, "g_as_written": null, "i": 12, "label": "Salt 0.5 tsp", "name": "Salt", "role": "kept", "water_g": 0.0}, {"as_written": null, "code": "K505", "g": 60.0, "g_as_written": null, "i": null, "label": "Water absorbed on rinsing/soaking the flakes: INDB BFP045''s own line, 60 ml per 40 g poha (BFP044 lists none, so its 294.5 kcal is a dry raw mix)", "name": "Water, distilled", "role": "added", "water_g": 60.0}]'::jsonb,
     '6a1261d97ad5bda784f42181435c6138176c7acddb410bf653ba37aa3ebdba3f', 'Poha: INDB BFP044 plus the soak water its sibling BFP045 lists (60 ml per 40 g flakes), with the oil cut so the dish''s fat is the Pune kanda pohe''s share of dry matter (lab 99, 11.7%). The rule pins total fat, not oil: BFP044''s peanut, which the lab dish does not have (it has coconut), carries 58% of that fat, so the implied oil (1.34 g per 40 g poha) is likely leaner than the lab cook''s. Supersedes the raw-mix row (294.5 kcal, no water). Cross-checked against NIN''s 270 kcal per cup of 50 g dry poha. Confidence C (recipe with an anchor-only fat rule, no moisture anchor).', 'founder 2026-11-13 (spec (i)2: soak water, lab-fat oil, confidence C)', '058'),
